    "District/alias -> province mapping for src/vietjobs/vitext.py (section 2.7).",
    "",
    "Fixes a fragmentation found in the data audit: 'hà đông' (859 rows) was a",
    "separate location value from 'hà nội' (13,232 rows), even though Hà Đông is",
    "a ward of Hanoi. Same story for the HCMC and Đà Nẵng districts.",
    "",
    "Keys are province names; values are the districts and spelling variants that",
    "should fold into them. Lookup is accent- and punctuation-insensitive, so",
    "'TP.HCM', 'tp hcm' and 'Tp. Hồ Chí Minh' all resolve through 'tphcm'.",
    "",
    "Not exhaustive over all 63 provinces — a province that appears in the data",
    "under its own name needs no entry, it passes through unchanged. Only the",
    "districts and aliases that actually cause fragmentation are listed."
